{"3590790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bloodright", "steam_appid": 3590790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590790/extras/147d7694bb0d724cfbe245b03d06eeee.avif?t=1761567914\" width=640 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a fog-covered night, Adrian’s car breaks down on a desolate road. Searching for help, he finds a looming mansion and steps inside—only for the door to lock behind him. With no way out, he must navigate its dark corridors, piece together its buried secrets, and survive the horrors that now stalk him in the shadows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590790/extras/cd4166241f60aeb9dfd707442d39da7a.avif?t=1761567914\" width=640 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590790/extras/fc36e73c457061395d135c3af2d6ad62.webp?t=1761567914\" width=768 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590790/extras/e4d93a5021403d2a9911a6a0890fc9f9.poster.avif?t=1761567914\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590790/extras/e4d93a5021403d2a9911a6a0890fc9f9.webm?t=1761567914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590790/extras/e4d93a5021403d2a9911a6a0890fc9f9.mp4?t=1761567914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><s